{"id":"f6f087e2448d2657","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-deligne-enough-points.md","title":"Theorem — Deligne 足够多点定理","display":"Theorem — Deligne 足够多点定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-deligne-enough-points","aliases":["14-thm-deligne-enough-points"],"display":"Theorem — Deligne 足够多点定理","depends_on":["[[14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi]]","[[14-df-enough-points]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-deligne-enough-points"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-deligne-enough-points</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Deligne 足够多点定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"37f646888720f3eb\" href=\"?note=37f646888720f3eb\" title=\"14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi\">14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4a60f42d4d762a6d\" href=\"?note=4a60f42d4d762a6d\" title=\"14-df-enough-points\">14-df-enough-points</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsCoherentTopos}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsCoherentTopos}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"37f646888720f3eb\" href=\"?note=37f646888720f3eb\" title=\"14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi\">14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi</a> 的有限型站点定义；足够多点见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4a60f42d4d762a6d\" href=\"?note=4a60f42d4d762a6d\" title=\"14-df-enough-points\">14-df-enough-points</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsCoherentTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{HasEnoughPoints}(\\mathcal E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsCoherentTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{HasEnoughPoints}(\\mathcal E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>精确来源：原书 IX.11 Corollary 3，印刷 p.521。源证明先用 Barr 覆盖及 Stone 空间延拓得到从有足够多点的空间层拓扑斯到 E 的满射，再把联合保守性沿复合传递。这里只声称核对原书陈述与假设，未重新形式化 Barr 定理证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi","status":"resolved","id":"37f646888720f3eb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-enough-points","status":"resolved","id":"4a60f42d4d762a6d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-enough-points]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi","status":"resolved","id":"37f646888720f3eb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsCoherentTopos}$ 采用 [[14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi]] 的有限型站点定义；足够多点见 [[14-df-enough-points]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-enough-points","status":"resolved","id":"4a60f42d4d762a6d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsCoherentTopos}$ 采用 [[14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi]] 的有限型站点定义；足够多点见 [[14-df-enough-points]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsCoherentTopos}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsCoherentTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{HasEnoughPoints}(\\mathcal E).","display":true}],"bytes":948,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-235","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-deligne-enough-points|Theorem — Deligne 足够多点定理]]"},{"id":"37f646888720f3eb","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"精确来源：原书 IX.11，印刷 p.519。有限覆盖族基等价于每个覆盖筛含一个生成覆盖筛的有限子族；这符合原书定义。旧[[14-thm-deligne-enough-points]]要求对任意余极限经单一分量因子化，不是相干性，例如 Set×Set 被错误排除。"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-deligne-enough-points]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-236","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-deligne-enough-points|Theorem — Deligne 足够多点定理]]"},{"id":"0ed40e4b73b2ad9a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["37f646888720f3eb","4a60f42d4d762a6d"]}